1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:06,843
This video shows you how to get an email when something in your fleet breaks,

2
00:00:06,843 --> 00:00:08,870
and again when it clears.

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:12,249
In Admin, open System, then Alerts.

4
00:00:12,249 --> 00:00:15,797
First, turn on the mail server.

5
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,341
Enter its host and port.

6
00:00:21,341 --> 00:00:25,287
Choose STARTTLS, which encrypts the mail on its way.

7
00:00:25,287 --> 00:00:29,301
Enter the address alerts come from, and save.

8
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,010
Add an email channel.

9
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:36,350
Name it ops-team, and send to ops@example.com.

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,910
Include the message, so the email says what to check.

11
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:40,940
Send a test.

12
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,226
The mail server accepted it.

13
00:00:43,226 --> 00:00:45,541
Then add the channel.

14
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:53,129
For chat or paging, add a webhook instead: Slack,

15
00:00:53,129 --> 00:00:57,387
Microsoft Teams, PagerDuty or generic JSON.

16
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:03,896
Under What each channel gets, tick the issues the channel receives.

17
00:01:03,896 --> 00:01:07,759
Here, all the issues about sources and destinations.

18
00:01:07,759 --> 00:01:08,730
Save.

19
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:15,515
Now the broker behind tutorial-out stops.

20
00:01:15,515 --> 00:01:18,950
The leader looks for issues every minute.

21
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:26,000
The email names Destination unreachable on tutorial-out, and says what to check.

22
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:32,744
Once the broker is back, a second email says it cleared.

23
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:37,231
Before planned work, mute the channel.

24
00:01:37,231 --> 00:01:40,491
It stays quiet for the time you choose.

25
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,195
Check on learning.

26
00:01:47,395 --> 00:01:51,272
Where do you choose which issues a channel gets?

27
00:01:55,672 --> 00:02:01,741
In Admin, System, Alerts, under What each channel gets.

28
00:02:02,641 --> 00:02:05,610
Next, size a worker.
